WEBVTT

00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:08.320
Stepping out on
an ordinary Sunday

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:14.830
Stepping out!
A miracle's gonna happen

00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:16.660
It's my day!

00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:27.240
Maybe I'll throw off my pajamas

00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:34.650
and head out to see her right now

00:00:36.610 --> 00:00:42.020
I always turned my eyes away,
thinking she'd hate me

00:00:43.690 --> 00:00:49.430
Now I'm saying goodbye
to that negative attitude

00:00:50.630 --> 00:00:55.200
My favorite shoes
will always take me

00:00:57.700 --> 00:01:02.340
To a place where I'll be happy

00:01:04.510 --> 00:01:09.850
It's not someone else
I want to embrace

00:01:11.550 --> 00:01:15.990
But a version of
myself that's not fake

00:01:15.990 --> 00:01:19.050
I just want to walk

00:01:19.390 --> 00:01:22.590
Not on tip-toe

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:26.560
Not downcast, either

00:01:27.530 --> 00:01:35.470
Just I'm stepping out
on an ordinary Sunday

00:01:35.470 --> 00:01:41.910
Stepping out!
Making a little try, try, try

00:01:41.910 --> 00:01:44.180
It's my day!

00:02:13.640 --> 00:02:15.390
Want to come to my house for tea?

00:02:15.390 --> 00:02:19.550
Ohh... How nice! I'd love to!

00:02:30.160 --> 00:02:31.320
It's like a dream...

00:02:31.320 --> 00:02:33.890
Getting to go to your house...

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:46.210
"The Arrival of Tsubaki Domyoji!"

00:02:55.950 --> 00:02:59.080
<i>I have no right to be so depressed.</i>

00:03:02.420 --> 00:03:03.360
<i>But...</i>

00:03:04.390 --> 00:03:05.920
Say, how about a cup of coffee?

00:03:10.030 --> 00:03:13.330
<i>Sakurako looked so smug.</i>

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:15.610
I know a nice little place.

00:03:16.270 --> 00:03:17.310
<i>What was that all about?!</i>

00:03:17.310 --> 00:03:19.270
Hey, I'm talking here... Hey!

00:03:19.740 --> 00:03:20.980
<i>That dirty...!</i>

00:03:21.310 --> 00:03:22.950
Let's go out someplace!

00:03:23.310 --> 00:03:28.020
Will you shut up!
Go out wherever you like!

00:03:30.080 --> 00:03:33.420
What?! Don't act so stuck up, piggy!

00:03:34.790 --> 00:03:36.020
What did you say?!

00:03:40.890 --> 00:03:42.430
Can't you take a hint?!

00:03:45.130 --> 00:03:48.940
Trying to pick up a girl in
a lame car like this?

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:51.090
Oh...

00:03:51.090 --> 00:03:53.820
You've got some nerve.

00:03:53.820 --> 00:03:57.470
Stop! I haven't even paid it off yet!

00:03:57.940 --> 00:03:59.120
Get lost, loser!

00:04:03.750 --> 00:04:05.580
Ass!

00:04:05.580 --> 00:04:09.020
Get yourself a better car
if you plan to pick up girls!

00:04:11.220 --> 00:04:12.560
<i>Wow!</i>

00:04:15.130 --> 00:04:18.070
Hey! Don't just stand there!

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:21.470
If this were L.A., you'd have been
snatched away and killed!

00:04:22.330 --> 00:04:23.710
<i>L.A.?</i>

00:04:29.610 --> 00:04:31.330
<i>What is it?</i>

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:34.180
Hey... you don't look so good.

00:04:34.180 --> 00:04:35.910
I d-don't?

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:39.500
I live right over there.
Why don't you come and rest.

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:42.370
O-oh, no! I couldn't do that.
I'm just fine, thanks.

00:04:42.370 --> 00:04:44.310
Don't worry. Just come with me.

00:04:44.310 --> 00:04:45.320
Oh!

00:04:50.690 --> 00:04:52.690
<i>She's so aggressive.</i>

00:05:04.670 --> 00:05:07.290
I'm sorry for yelling like that.

00:05:10.450 --> 00:05:13.980
<i>She's beautiful! Almost as
beautiful as Shizuka...</i>

00:05:14.880 --> 00:05:17.550
I just got back from America today.

00:05:18.490 --> 00:05:21.990
Stuff like that happens all the time there.

00:05:22.820 --> 00:05:24.290
Thanks for your help.

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:29.900
<i>She looks so familiar...</i>

00:05:31.570 --> 00:05:32.830
We're almost there.

00:05:33.300 --> 00:05:34.400
All right.

00:05:35.300 --> 00:05:38.310
<i>But, I'd never forget
someone so beautiful...</i>

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:41.760
<i>Who is she? Did I see her in
a magazine, or on television?</i>

00:05:41.760 --> 00:05:42.710
Here we are.

00:05:45.350 --> 00:05:48.720
Ah, the old homestead!
I haven't seen it in three years!

00:05:59.390 --> 00:06:03.070
Oh, I'm Tsubaki Domyoji,
by the way. Come in.

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:06.200
<i>Now I remember...</i>

00:06:08.830 --> 00:06:11.340
<i>I saw her portrait once...</i>

00:06:12.200 --> 00:06:14.810
<i>She's Domyoji's big sister!</i>

00:06:17.180 --> 00:06:19.700
What's wrong? Come on.

00:06:19.700 --> 00:06:22.470
Uh... I... I'm fine. 
I'm gonna go home.

00:06:22.470 --> 00:06:25.320
Absolutely not! You're looking
even paler now.

00:06:25.680 --> 00:06:28.820
<i>Oh, no... Domyoji 
and Sakurako are here!</i>

00:06:29.290 --> 00:06:31.760
I have a brother, too.
I'll introduce you.

00:06:32.120 --> 00:06:33.490
<i>I know that!</i>

00:06:36.840 --> 00:06:40.350
Oh, my! Miss Tsubaki...
Welcome home.

00:06:40.350 --> 00:06:43.350
I'm glad to be home. 
Where's Tsukasa?

00:06:44.070 --> 00:06:45.270
Oh, no!

00:06:45.740 --> 00:06:49.200
He's here... with a pretty young lady.

00:06:49.200 --> 00:06:51.060
What? A young lady?

00:06:51.060 --> 00:06:54.610
He's brought a girl home?
How unbecoming!

00:06:55.710 --> 00:06:57.300
<i>Help me!</i>

00:06:58.150 --> 00:07:03.450
Sis! What are you doing home?
You should've called.

00:07:04.660 --> 00:07:06.520
Did your husband kick you ou...

00:07:09.730 --> 00:07:13.460
Your sister's back, and you don't
even welcome her?

00:07:14.730 --> 00:07:16.330
That elbow hasn't lost its punch...

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:20.240
My... You're his sister?
You're so beautiful!

00:07:21.510 --> 00:07:25.780
I'm Sakurako Sanjo.
I'm very happy to meet you.

00:07:28.810 --> 00:07:33.350
Is she really your type?
I think I just got a sugar buzz!

00:07:33.350 --> 00:07:35.570
Shut up! It's not like that.

00:07:38.790 --> 00:07:41.860
And you talk to your big sister
with that mouth?!

00:07:42.160 --> 00:07:43.760
Ow...

00:07:44.290 --> 00:07:45.840
Oh! That's right...

00:07:46.700 --> 00:07:49.850
I helped a girl who wasn't
feeling well... Huh?

00:07:49.850 --> 00:07:51.670
There's nobody there.

00:07:52.870 --> 00:07:55.640
Where'd she go? Strange...

00:07:56.040 --> 00:07:57.570
She was right here...

00:07:58.640 --> 00:08:00.060
I was sure she was...

00:08:00.480 --> 00:08:02.280
Must've been your imaging.

00:08:03.310 --> 00:08:09.890
Listen... The word's imagination.
I-ma-gi-na-tion.

00:08:10.220 --> 00:08:13.320
Agh! Home five minutes, and
already I'm knee deep in idiocy!

00:08:13.320 --> 00:08:14.380
I hate this!

00:08:14.380 --> 00:08:16.890
Shut up! Why in the
 hell are you home?

00:08:18.030 --> 00:08:20.920
My husband had to go to
Europe for business.

00:08:20.920 --> 00:08:23.970
I get bored when I'm all alone,
so I came home.

00:08:24.530 --> 00:08:27.570
The tea is ready. This way...

00:08:28.670 --> 00:08:29.540
Now's my chance!

00:08:41.320 --> 00:08:42.250
Phew...

00:08:43.950 --> 00:08:46.170
<i>I've got to get out of here quickly!</i>

00:08:50.520 --> 00:08:52.260
Was the entrance this way?

00:08:54.560 --> 00:08:55.700
Nope...

00:09:01.400 --> 00:09:03.270
I think it was this way.

00:09:08.070 --> 00:09:09.410
What is this room?

00:09:10.610 --> 00:09:11.630
Huh?

00:09:12.450 --> 00:09:13.480
Oh...

00:09:14.550 --> 00:09:16.320
Uh-oh. Not here.

00:09:18.920 --> 00:09:22.250
Oh, man... Why is this house
so huge?

00:09:25.390 --> 00:09:26.790
Thank you for everything.

00:09:27.260 --> 00:09:30.000
I'm sorry for taking so much
of your time.

00:09:38.700 --> 00:09:39.710
What?

00:09:40.270 --> 00:09:42.870
A late bloomer like you, with a girlfriend...

00:09:43.740 --> 00:09:45.840
It's not like that between us.

00:09:47.610 --> 00:09:51.150
Really? I could've sworn...

00:09:52.580 --> 00:09:56.020
In the three years since I left,
you've become a better man.

00:09:56.350 --> 00:09:59.990
You were sharp as a blade,
but I think your edge has softened.

00:10:00.390 --> 00:10:03.760
I just assumed you'd found
yourself a girl.

00:11:03.750 --> 00:11:04.650
<i>Oh, no...</i>

00:11:08.620 --> 00:11:11.970
Um... you see... Your sister said
I wasn't feeling well and, uh...

00:11:11.970 --> 00:11:15.160
I was looking for the door and, uh...
coming back from Rui Hanazawa's...

00:11:15.700 --> 00:11:16.630
Rui's?

00:11:17.170 --> 00:11:19.500
<i>Oh, no... What am I saying?</i>

00:11:19.800 --> 00:11:22.930
You stopped by on your way home
from your boyfriend's?

00:11:22.930 --> 00:11:27.600
N-no... that's not it.
I didn't know... that she was your...

00:11:27.600 --> 00:11:28.610
Enough, already!

00:11:31.980 --> 00:11:35.240
Do you know what you are doing?

00:11:39.620 --> 00:11:42.460
You can't complain,
no matter what I do to you.

00:11:43.360 --> 00:11:46.830
Wait, Domyoji! Listen to what
I've got to say, please!

00:11:49.960 --> 00:11:52.660
<i>I'm scared... 
What is he planning to do?</i>

00:11:54.570 --> 00:11:55.300
Oh!

00:12:01.880 --> 00:12:04.440
Don't ever set foot here
without my permission!

00:12:40.810 --> 00:12:44.650
Having fun jumping
 from one guy to another?

00:12:45.320 --> 00:12:46.520
A girl like you...

00:12:51.220 --> 00:12:53.160
Did you look at Rui with these eyes?

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:55.290
And kiss him with these lips?

00:12:56.360 --> 00:12:58.420
And hold him with these arms?

00:13:01.630 --> 00:13:03.960
Do you enjoy playing with
other people's hearts?

00:13:07.170 --> 00:13:11.440
Too bad... I don't feel anything
for you anymore.

00:13:14.510 --> 00:13:16.580
You're like the weeds out there.

00:13:26.290 --> 00:13:27.830
What are you doing?!

00:13:27.830 --> 00:13:31.430
Going into heat every time
you see a girl! Disgraceful!

00:13:31.800 --> 00:13:34.460
I didn't raise you that way!

00:13:36.900 --> 00:13:40.570
Are you all right?
Did he try to do anything?

00:13:41.910 --> 00:13:42.970
Listen to me...

00:13:44.410 --> 00:13:47.140
All he deserves is this!

00:13:50.950 --> 00:13:53.350
This, and this, and this!

00:13:54.650 --> 00:13:57.480
W-wait a minute...
You don't understand.

00:13:59.790 --> 00:14:02.450
I wondered where you'd
disappeared to.

00:14:02.450 --> 00:14:06.330
I thought you'd gone home,
but here you are.

00:14:06.730 --> 00:14:08.850
This is the brother I mentioned earlier.

00:14:08.850 --> 00:14:09.720
Uh... I...

00:14:09.720 --> 00:14:12.000
I thought he'd turned into
a better man, but...

00:14:12.000 --> 00:14:14.620
Then he brought
this sugar-sweet girl home.

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:16.790
Tsubaki... to tell you the truth...

00:14:16.790 --> 00:14:18.730
Let's forget about him and go.

00:14:18.730 --> 00:14:19.880
Tsubaki!

00:14:20.280 --> 00:14:23.460
<i>She hasn't heard a word I've said.</i>

00:14:23.460 --> 00:14:26.280
<i>I'm trying to tell you, I know him!</i>

00:14:27.620 --> 00:14:28.620
Sis...

00:14:34.590 --> 00:14:37.290
Tsukasa didn't come, after all.

00:14:39.730 --> 00:14:43.260
That boy... How long
 is he going to mope?

00:14:48.900 --> 00:14:50.920
<i>What am I doing here?</i>

00:14:50.920 --> 00:14:53.500
<i>It's a rotten time for a leisurely dinner.</i>

00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:56.890
Eat up! You haven't eaten a thing.

00:14:56.890 --> 00:14:58.180
Y-yes, ma'am!

00:14:58.680 --> 00:15:00.090
<i>She's so aggressive...</i>

00:15:00.090 --> 00:15:01.680
<i>Just like Domyoji.</i>

00:15:02.220 --> 00:15:05.890
I think I'll go and give Tsukasa
another taste of my fist.

00:15:06.950 --> 00:15:08.290
W-wait!

00:15:08.790 --> 00:15:11.160
It's okay. Wait here for me.

00:15:19.530 --> 00:15:22.070
<i>What a huge table!</i>

00:15:22.640 --> 00:15:27.140
<i>I wonder if Domyoji eats all alone
here when Tsubaki's not around.</i>

00:15:29.640 --> 00:15:32.150
<i>I don't suppose he gets lonely...</i>

00:15:32.910 --> 00:15:36.450
<i>He's lived like this since he was little.
He's used to it.</i>

00:15:42.320 --> 00:15:45.390
<i>Oh, dear. I'm so sleepy.</i>

00:15:45.860 --> 00:15:49.800
<i>After that date with Rui Hanazawa,
I was dragged in here...</i>

00:15:52.000 --> 00:15:57.470
<i>The last time I was here,
Domyoji kissed me...</i>

00:15:59.870 --> 00:16:04.980
<i>And yet, here I am again...
I'm not surprised that he's angry.</i>

00:16:08.480 --> 00:16:10.220
Tsukasa's not in his room.

00:16:10.650 --> 00:16:14.090
Master Tsukasa went into
the bathroom a few minutes ago.

00:16:14.820 --> 00:16:16.660
That boy!

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:26.360
You'll catch a cold.

00:16:27.270 --> 00:16:28.400
Rui Hanazawa...

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:29.930
Huh?

00:16:30.340 --> 00:16:32.370
Rui Hanazawa...

00:16:37.740 --> 00:16:39.580
Rui Hanazawa?

00:16:40.440 --> 00:16:43.820
I'm sorry... Domyoji...

00:16:56.330 --> 00:16:57.390
Why should I?

00:16:57.390 --> 00:17:01.000
Never mind. Just carry her!
It's your big sister's order...

00:17:02.530 --> 00:17:04.430
Why do I have to carry her?!

00:17:20.250 --> 00:17:22.250
<i>I'm floating...</i>

00:17:22.820 --> 00:17:27.090
<i>Someone is holding me softly
like I'm something fragile.</i>

00:17:27.990 --> 00:17:34.000
<i>Who is it? Who's carrying
this awful person so gently?</i>

00:17:43.070 --> 00:17:45.040
Did I wake you? I'm sorry.

00:17:45.640 --> 00:17:46.610
What is this?

00:17:47.110 --> 00:17:48.110
It's a toy.

00:17:49.310 --> 00:17:52.620
Is this what's popular in Japan?
Show me how to use it.

00:17:52.620 --> 00:17:56.950
All right. You can predict things,
or play games on it.

00:18:02.290 --> 00:18:09.000
What's this? Does this say you're torn
between two boys?

00:18:11.700 --> 00:18:13.190
What an interesting game!

00:18:13.190 --> 00:18:15.870
Uh... well, actually...

00:18:17.740 --> 00:18:18.490
Hey...

00:18:18.490 --> 00:18:19.370
Yes?

00:18:19.710 --> 00:18:22.360
I wish you wouldn't give up on Tsukasa.

00:18:22.360 --> 00:18:23.240
Huh?

00:18:24.910 --> 00:18:28.250
You seem to know Tsukasa,
and there's some problem, but...

00:18:31.820 --> 00:18:35.860
I think I can trust Tsukasa to
someone like you.

00:18:39.830 --> 00:18:41.260
Tsubaki...

00:18:42.600 --> 00:18:45.630
His feathers get ruffled easily,
but he's not a bad boy.

00:18:46.400 --> 00:18:49.370
So you see... 
Try to understand him.

00:18:51.940 --> 00:18:55.270
<i>Tsubaki... I do understand...</i>

00:18:56.710 --> 00:18:59.810
<i>He's an idiot... 
rowdy and self-centered...</i>

00:19:00.280 --> 00:19:03.720
<i>Always saying the opposite of
what he feels...</i>

00:19:05.020 --> 00:19:09.190
<i>But he's very genuine...
just has trouble expressing himself.</i>

00:19:09.490 --> 00:19:11.420
<i>He's kind and gentle in many ways.</i>

00:19:13.130 --> 00:19:14.190
<i>But...</i>

00:19:21.270 --> 00:19:23.240
<i>I have no right...</i>

00:19:25.370 --> 00:19:29.310
<i>I have no right to hang on to him.</i>

00:19:47.630 --> 00:19:51.960
<i>I don't feel anything for you anymore.</i>

00:20:08.110 --> 00:20:09.880
I feel sorry for Hanazawa!

00:20:12.220 --> 00:20:14.750
To be deceived by someone
as low-class as you!

00:20:15.590 --> 00:20:17.250
I... I didn't deceive him.

00:20:17.250 --> 00:20:19.130
Of course, you did!

00:20:19.920 --> 00:20:23.630
Otherwise, he'd never give
a lowlife like you the time of day.

00:20:25.600 --> 00:20:27.740
That's none of your business.

00:20:30.670 --> 00:20:31.660
Hana...

00:20:31.660 --> 00:20:37.250
Sounds like the pots are
calling the kettle black.

00:20:38.410 --> 00:20:39.440
Pots...?

00:20:40.980 --> 00:20:42.240
<i>Rui Hanazawa...</i>

00:20:50.620 --> 00:20:51.930
<i>Domyoji?</i>

00:20:56.460 --> 00:20:58.200
Listen up, everybody...

00:20:58.790 --> 00:21:01.940
Rui Hanazawa is no longer
a member of the F4.

00:22:05.490 --> 00:22:11.560
You let your hair down a little

00:22:13.530 --> 00:22:19.440
You hid the fact
that you were crying

00:22:21.210 --> 00:22:29.320
I noticed, but I
couldn't ask you why

00:22:29.550 --> 00:22:37.360
I can never be
honest about how I feel

00:22:37.360 --> 00:22:45.130
Until after we've split
up after a bad fight

00:22:45.400 --> 00:22:53.270
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:22:45.400 --> 00:22:53.270
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:22:53.270 --> 00:23:01.650
I can say "I love you"...

00:22:53.270 --> 00:23:01.650
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:03.450 --> 00:23:11.420
Do you really hate me this time?

00:23:11.420 --> 00:23:19.200
Will you end up running to him?

00:23:19.460 --> 00:23:27.370
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:23:19.460 --> 00:23:27.370
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:27.370 --> 00:23:35.780
I can say "I love you"...

00:23:27.370 --> 00:23:35.780
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:47.520 --> 00:23:48.690
Domyoji!

00:23:48.790 --> 00:23:52.630
How can you get Rui Hanazawa
and me expelled from school?

00:23:52.930 --> 00:23:55.160
Rui Hanazawa is taking it in stride.

00:23:55.500 --> 00:23:59.030
But what can I say to my parents?
This means so much to them!

00:23:59.670 --> 00:24:02.870
Next on Hana Yori Dango:
"Love's Tempest! Being Expelled?!"

00:24:03.470 --> 00:24:05.310
I have nothing but
bad memories here, but...

00:24:05.740 --> 00:24:07.810
Good-bye, Eitoku Academy.
